2026-09-01T14:01Z claude note ZOTEUS_CONDUCTOR defaults to OFF -- flagged for the author. The exit criterion asks for a real production file path, and the call site is production code on the startup path exercised by the same function the tests drive; but nothing on the query path reads v2 yet, so opening it unconditionally would put a new file in every user's data directory in exchange for no behaviour. One line to flip once a tranche actually reads it.
